    "Name": "Anubis ABS-4C",
    "Details": "Designed by Fredonian Industrial Technologies, the Anubis was originally designed to compliment the Osiris BattleMech in use by the Federated Suns. The 'Mech's lightweight chassis carries a powerful Ceres Motors 250 XL engine that gives the Anubis a top speed of 129.6 km/h and is covered in a protective skin of Hellespont Lite Stealth Armor, making the Anubis extremely hard to hit at long range. The typical LRM-5 launchers have been replaced by two MML-5s instead, along with four tons of mixed ammunition. An advanced Guardian ECM Suite is fitted to the center torso to power the stealth armor.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Extended Torso Twist</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.99</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
